gle.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/r-inla-discussion-group/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/r-inla-discussion-group/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445832936000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3i6J2Yb0psAVqWqRLhxGV-\">View all topics</a>\r\n  </span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font:13px/18px arial;color:#222222;padding:0px;margin-bottom:30px\">\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_2042028879841976200_14c2f81767ce56c9_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      Warning message</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:#777777\">1 Update</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_2042028879841976200_14c2f81767ce56c9_group_thread_1\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      Error</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:#777777\">2 Updates</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_2042028879841976200_14c2f81767ce56c9_group_thread_2\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      indexing: replicate vs group</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:#777777\">2 Updates</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_2042028879841976200_14c2f81767ce56c9_group_thread_3\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      some questions about graph file</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:#777777\">2 Updates</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_2042028879841976200_14c2f81767ce56c9_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/t/46972c7d7fa87e35?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/t/46972c7d7fa87e35?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445832936000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3KBnIGuswq1wF49VUQkOrA\">\r\n      Warning message\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        Amanda Waclawczyk &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">amandawa...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Mar 18 12:31PM -0700\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Hi, <br>\r\n <br>\r\nDo these warning messages matter or can I ignore them?<br>\r\n <br>\r\n&quot;*** Warning *** Numerical error gives b22 = -4.29497e+009 &lt;= 0.0 for <br>\r\nidx=41453. setting b22=1.49167e-154<br>\r\n <br>\r\n*** Warning ***\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/8443d1ac80615e6c?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/8443d1ac80615e6c?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445832936000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0tnvZ_17XW0BbqEfOF7fFy\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_2042028879841976200_14c2f81767ce56c9_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_2042028879841976200_14c2f81767ce56c9_group_thread_1\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/t/ed93badaa6626a0b?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/t/ed93badaa6626a0b?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445832936000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3026_ye04yUpu7pXCbWf7E\">\r\n      Error\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        Amanda Waclawczyk &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">amandawa...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Mar 18 11:49AM -0700\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Good afternoon, the model I am trying to run will not work. Can you help me <br>\r\nfigure out the problem?<br>\r\n <br>\r\nThe number of observations = 330763.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nThe following is part of the error message from my log\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/49dbfb56ba751e0a?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/49dbfb56ba751e0a?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445832936000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2B-QTAi2xdBQn9yim9NaKa\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        Håvard Rue &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hr...@math.ntnu.no</a>&gt;: Mar 18 07:51PM +0100\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      On Wed, 2015-03-18 at 11:49 -0700, Amanda Waclawczyk wrote:<br>\r\n&gt; Good afternoon, the model I am trying to run will not work. Can you<br>\r\n&gt; help me figure out the problem?<br>\r\n <br>\r\n&gt; The number of observations =\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/23cf5559adf652c7?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/23cf5559adf652c7?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445832936000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ogTgMl8kzUAAxuya2p9Nr\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_2042028879841976200_14c2f81767ce56c9_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_2042028879841976200_14c2f81767ce56c9_group_thread_2\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/t/e960e99c4b78a25?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/t/e960e99c4b78a25?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445832936000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ditUeQCGPgkD4D8rHeBcg\">\r\n      indexing: replicate vs group\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        SpNine &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">s9p...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Mar 18 09:50AM -0700\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      My question is new but has the same heading so I post here…<br>\r\n <br>\r\nSorry for a simple question but I am struggling to understand the <br>\r\ndifference between replicate and group. For instance, in the\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/45a449ccb475409f?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/45a449ccb475409f?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445832937000&amp;usg=AOvVaw05Yz8ZkKbXVEvlK9n8qmCo\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        INLA help &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">he...@r-inla.org</a>&gt;: Mar 18 07:28PM +0100\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      On Wed, 2015-03-18 at 09:50 -0700, SpNine wrote:<br>\r\n&gt; correlation is the same across all groups. I think using “replicate”<br>\r\n&gt; assumes that it is, but I can&#39;t find much documentation about what\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/eb2365d52522b1e0?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/eb2365d52522b1e0?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445832937000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3gfilC89djuEFqVW6sazZF\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_2042028879841976200_14c2f81767ce56c9_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_2042028879841976200_14c2f81767ce56c9_group_thread_3\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/t/afb088234724a971?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/t/afb088234724a971?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445832937000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1mOTKyEtrzJ_Yv1DeZy2c_\">\r\n      some questions about graph file\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jpkr...@gmail.com</a>: Mar 17 11:37PM -0700\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      On Tuesday, March 17, 2015 at 5:31:15 PM UTC+1, LC Chien wrote:<br>\r\n&gt; code inside, I still cannot identify where area 19 is from the map. If <br>\r\n&gt; there is a way to put the recoded area code from the graph\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/4760503a5cd72971?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/4760503a5cd72971?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445832937000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3vJzGdhzT3OWZ5uTcmSWVt\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        LC Chien &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">chie...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Mar 18 10:51AM -0700\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Thank you James. With your suggestion, I have identified those counties <br>\r\nwithout neighbors, and they are all islands in northeast and northwest US.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nSo the next step is: I want to add neighbors for\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/475f06ec667edeca?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/msg/475f06ec667edeca?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792445832937000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2V6RKf5-KD9TJjMaOVCVzp\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_2042028879841976200_14c2f81767ce56c9_dig